[00:00.000] 作曲 : Cas P. Ian
[00:07.770]Circus
[00:10.472]Clown
[00:13.413]No i don’t blame the circus
[00:16.158]I blame the clown
[00:18.948]I try to lighten you up
[00:21.875]But you weigh me down
[00:24.560]When i was your little dog
[00:26.736]You tied me to the ground
[00:30.177]I’d be chained up out back all the while you’re running round
[00:35.933]I used to be your marionette
[00:38.556]Dancing on your string
[00:41.378]Now i am a real boy
[00:44.173]And i begin to sing
[00:46.975]I’ve got a beating heart
[00:49.787]Not made of wood
[00:52.592]You wouldn’t be crying tonight
[00:54.757]If you did as you should
